text:
499 helpers. Pattern: `return config.cache['item_N']`. Three differ:

```js
// helper_1   — baseline (no fallback, no transform)
function helper_1() { return config.cache['item_1']; }

// helper_250 — nullish coalesce fallback
function helper_250() { return config.cache['item_250'] ?? fallbackCache['item_250']; }

// helper_499 — legacy key normalization wrapper
function helper_499() { return normalizeLegacyKey(config.cache['item_499']); }
```

All others: `return config.cache['item_N'];` — identical to helper_1.
